- A cart with a map for O(1) lookups by item ID
- Adding items accumulates quantity for existing entries
- Removing and updating handle the `ErrItemNotFound` case
- `UpdateQuantity` with zero or negative removes the item entirely
- `GetTotal` calculates price × quantity across all items
- `ItemCount` sums all quantities, not unique items

